Generic single-database configuration for Alembic.

This directory contains the migration environment for the Alternative Data Platform.

Usage:
------

# Generate a new migration (autogenerate from model changes):
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description of changes"

# Apply all pending migrations:
alembic upgrade head

# Revert the last migration:
alembic downgrade -1

# View current revision:
alembic current

# View migration history:
alembic history

# Generate SQL without applying (offline mode):
alembic upgrade head --sql > migration.sql

Notes:
------
- The database URL is loaded from settings (DATABASE_URL env var)
- All models must be imported in env.py for autogenerate to detect changes
- Review autogenerated migrations before applying - they may need manual edits
